#: ../../tools/drug_synergy_tools.rst:32 8b6b95bef33c4ec8bab106d500af1b21
msgid ""
"**Description**: Calculate Bliss Independence synergy score for a drug "
"combination. Model: E\\_expected = E\\_a + E\\_b - E\\_a\\*E\\_b. Synergy"
" score = (E\\_combo - E\\_expected) \\* 100. Positive = synergy; Negative"
" = antagonism. Inputs are fractional inhibition values (0-1). Based on "
"Bliss (1939). Use for: single-concentration combination screening, high-"
"throughput synergy assessment."
msgstr ""

