"drug combinations across dose points. HSA expected = max(E\\_a, E\\_b) at"
" each dose. Synergy = observed - HSA expected. Requires matching arrays "
"of effects for drug A, drug B, and the combination. Use for: multi-dose "
"combination matrices, identifying synergistic dose ranges."
